/E (Before CSIS, I served for four years in the Army as a forward observer, including two deployments to Afghanistan. In 2010, while stationed at Camp Casey, South Korea, I participated in a bilateral UAS airborne weapons demonstration. My takeaway then was that the aircraft was impressive but too large and too slow to change how we fought. )
