130 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 53 0 R
/E (Low-cost interceptors are high on my list because affordable rounds let a unit sustain its defense through repeated attacks. Directed energy also deserves serious attention. JIATF-401 has selected five installations for a counter-UAS pilot program incorporating high-energy lasers and high-power microwave systems. That is an opportunity to learn what these technologies can sustain under operational conditions.  )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3 186 0 R 5]
>>
